     On write ([dev_wdc.c](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L2016-L2021)), `idata` (an 8-bit `data[0]` byte at [dev_wdc.c](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L1189)) is split into `d->sdh_resv = idata & 0xa0`, `d->lba = (idata >> 6) & 1`, `d->drive = (idata >> 4) & 1`, and `d->head = idata & 0xf`. On read ([dev_wdc.c](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L2008-L2009)), `odata = d->sdh_resv | (d->lba << 6) | (d->drive << 4) | d->head`. Because the bit masks `0xa0`, `0x40`, `0x10`, and `0x0f` are pairwise disjoint and partition `0xff`, `odata == idata` for all 256 byte values `0x00..0xff` (and `0x00` at power-on after `memset(d, 0, sizeof(struct wdc_data))` at [dev_wdc.c](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_wdc.c#L2084)).
