WRONG DISPOSITIONS: K3, K4, K8

1. **Q1 — Corrections still owed**

   **K3 — READ / DERIVED:** The disclosure decision stands, but its rationale is partly false. A narrowed head mask can redirect an out-of-image address into the existing backed image; distinguishing that error does **not necessarily require a larger image**. [GLM Q12:25](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdclbaaddr/pass2_20261024/ollama_glm_t4p2_Q12.txt:25) explicitly describes that distinction and recommends disclosure because adding a row changes the instrument revision. Correct the larger-image assertion and its attribution.

   **K4 — READ / DERIVED:** The regenerated manifest still incorrectly says “every preserved reading was (16, 63).” [rev_equivalence.txt:20](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdclbaaddr/detector_20261024/rev_equivalence.txt:20) records one `(None, None)` reading. Amend the blurb to include the dead-run exception and explain that both predicates reject it. Score transfer remains valid.

   **K8 — READ:** The claimed records correction is incomplete: [BUILD_REPORT_mainloop.md:46](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdclbaaddr/detector_20261024/BUILD_REPORT_mainloop.md:46) still identifies the fix witness simply as “19:04.” Apply the agreed two-leg 19:02–19:04 description there. This does not establish that the fix leg could not have occurred at 19:04.

   **READ / DERIVED:** K2’s added measurement records 30/33 and `CONTROL=FAIL`; K6’s capacity claim matches the source assignments. The remaining dispositions have no demonstrated substantive reversal. K10’s current hunk adds **31** lines; the report’s **25** is explicitly historical and should remain labeled that way.

   **NOT CHECKABLE:** The named `ledger_ops_pass1.json`, CHANGELOG draft, and promised OUTSTANDING additions were not available in the supplied artifacts. Their inclusion cannot be independently certified.

2. **Q2 — D1 and D2**

   **D1 — DERIVED:** Uphold **DISCLOSED**, with K3’s rationale corrected. The guarded bodies do not conditionally partition head, cylinder, or sector values. Under the stated DEPENDS-ON rule, these unsampled values and combinations belong to clause-(e) disclosure; their detectability does not itself make another row mandatory.

   **D2 — READ / DERIVED:** Uphold **L4 correction in place**. [PRETABLE.out:109](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdclbaaddr/detector_20261024/PRETABLE.out:109) preserves the historical predictions and appends explicit corrections. Artifact status does not excuse false coverage prose. Those prediction errors do not invalidate the measured kills or require detector-code changes.

3. **Q3 — Landing and K9**

   **DERIVED:** **Ready after the records corrections above and inclusion of the promised same-commit filings.** No reviewed item requires a product-code change, another mandatory row, or a kill-table rerun.

   **READ / DERIVED:** The retained AST comparison limits the executable difference from the frozen instrument to the geometry predicate. Both predicates agree on the preserved observations, including rejecting `(None, None)`. Revision `96e5fbc5` also has its own successful GATE and two-leg measurements. That supports transferring the recorded scores. **NOT CHECKABLE:** Exact byte ancestry through `5e4ecd47`, whose bytes were not preserved; this limitation does not defeat that transfer argument.

   **K9 — READ / DERIVED:** Adequate discharge of the obligation to execute the integrated block. [GATE10_RUN.txt:926](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdclbaaddr/pass2_20261024/GATE10_RUN.txt:926) records all five checks passing. The full gate nevertheless **failed 1/405**, with GD-ROM reporting 62 rows against the 60-row pin. Records must retain that distinction and identify the `PMAX` override; they cannot claim a whole-gate PASS or validation of the default build binary.

   **NOT CHECKABLE:** The retained gate header establishes the `dev_wdc.c` comparison, binary identity, and timestamp ordering—not whole-clone equivalence to HEAD plus this fix. Describe that broader provenance as reported, rather than independently established.
